    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -130,
      "params": {
        "text": "Pioneer terrain improvement (spec/systems/terrain_improvement.md func_040656 clear/plow, func_0409D6 road). A Pioneer holds the order for several turns: work-counter (+0x16) increments each turn until it reaches the per-terrain threshold (clear/plow = terrain_table+2, road = terrain_table), HALVED for a Hardy Pioneer. On completion 20 tools are spent and the tile byte changes: CLEAR forest = terrain id - 8 (+ lumber to the colony), PLOW = set bit 0x40 (+1 crop), ROAD = set bit 0x08 (movement). Switch on the order; FLAGGED: per-terrain threshold values are the @TERRAIN stride-16 table (here a Constant=4)."
      }
